{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FAR FROM DEAD - Demo Ver. -</strong> is a standalone, free-to-play preview of the upcoming run 'n gun boss rush game, FAR FROM DEAD. Challenge the first two bosses and get a taste of the full release!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>*Completed demo progress will automatically carry over into the full version automatically!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630670/extras/heading_text_far_from_dead.png?t=1744377813\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FAR FROM DEAD</strong> is a twitchy shoot 'em up boss rush game inspired by run 'n gun classics. Face off against seven challenging bosses, armed with only your trusty handgun and gratuitous i-frames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630670/extras/gif_dm_1_616.gif?t=1744377813\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630670/extras/heading_text_features.png?t=1744377813\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SEVEN UNIQUE BOSSES</strong>: Each boss has a distinctive and devastating set of tricks and traps to stop you. Learn their patterns and conquer all seven to earn your victory. (*Demo content includes the first two bosses)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BOB AND WEAVE</strong>: Master the art of dashing through attacks and wall jumping to evade your foes. Then, strike back with your trusty handgun.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630670/extras/gif_ll_1_616.gif?t=1744377813\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TRY, TRY AGAIN</strong>: While failure is expected, each fight is concise, meaning you'll never be set back too far. Find your flow state and push past the finish line.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>TOUGH, BUT FAIR</strong>: Need a hand? Use the included Assist Mode to fine-tune the difficulty of your experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HANDCRAFTED</strong>: Experience hand-pixeled art and an original chiptune soundtrack.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630670/extras/gif_dr_1_616.gif?t=1744377813\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630670?t=1744377813","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630670/3df17b979559c9a4c5a0c0d21009dbc0d8e2bced/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744377813","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630670/3b197c0cd907a89bbff0187369c4589d2323b966/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744377813","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630670/3b197c0cd907a89bbff0187369c4589d2323b966/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744377813","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FAR FROM DEAD - Demo Ver. -</strong> is a standalone, free-to-play preview of the upcoming run 'n gun boss rush game, FAR FROM DEAD. Challenge the first two bosses and get a taste of the full release!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>*Completed demo progress will automatically carry over into the full version automatica